msgctxt "380"
msgid "Ugh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid "Ow..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "404"
msgid "Looks like your fortune was wrong... Again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "416"
msgid "Oh, come on! This is how the world works."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "428"
msgid ""
"You make a little line of customers in front of your store and make it look "
"popular. Soon people will start talking about it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Then you just wait for idiots like you to show up and take their cash."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "That's pathetic."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"But as far as fortune telling goes, I'm not a fraud. I used to be a famous "
"fortune teller."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "476"
msgid ""
"I was right about you, wasn't I? I told you you were being fooled by "
"someone..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "488"
msgid "That person was me! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "500"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Not funny, huh? Anyway... I've lost my flair for fortune telling lately, "
"which is why I've been running this little gig."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid ""
"But you made me realize... This is a good time for me to retire. The world "
"doesn't need fortune tellers who can't read fortunes."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid ""
"It's good to know when to stop. You based your business on deception, but "
"your fortunes themselves weren't half bad."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid "Ah, a man who recognizes quality!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"The moment I saw your face, everything just came together. I felt that old "
"energy I used to feel."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"But I'm tired of all this. I'm going to live the rest of my days peacefully "
"with my sons. Please, just forget I was ever here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "Don't tell anyone you saw me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "Got it. I can keep a secret."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "704"
msgid "Where's that fortune teller? I know I heard that voice of hers!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "716"
msgid "There you are! How'd it go? Did you find her?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "728"
msgid "Actually..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "740"
msgid "I couldn't find her. I don't think she's hanging around here anymore."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "752"
msgid "Oh... I swear I heard her voice just now, though..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "Let's try over there! I'm getting my 30,000 yen back, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "The fortune teller went that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid "Really!? Okay, we're heading that way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "908"
msgid "After her! I'm getting my 30,000 yen back, you hear me?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"All right, now. One at a time. I put your wages in here, and then I want "
"you all back next time we do this."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"It's so easy! We get money just for lining up! Call me whenever you need "
"help."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"I will. In fact, we might have a TV station filming out here next week. "
"I'll definitely call on all of you then."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "Okay! I'll make sure to say how good you are!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"Thanks to all of you, I found a mark willing to pay 120,000 yen, so I've "
"given each of you a bonus of 1,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1136"
msgid "All right. What's going on here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1148"
msgid "Oh! It's you..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1160"
msgid "What's with all these people?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1172"
msgid "What's it to you? You seemed pleased with my fortune, if I recall correctly."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1184"
msgid ""
"I'm not asking you to give me my money back. I just want you to stop paying "
"people to make it look like you have satisfied customers."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1196"
msgid "Do you have a problem with the way I do things?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1208"
msgid "Keep talking like that, and I'll introduce you to my charming sons."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1220"
msgid ""
"You should know that my boys aren't like the puny waifs you normally deal "
"with..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1232"
msgid "Oh, boys! Would you come here for a moment? This man wants to talk to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1256"
msgid "What is it, Mom? Is this man accusing you of something?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1268"
msgid "Yes, give this man a scolding, please..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1280"
msgid "Hehe... Would you like me to read your fortune now? Why, I predict..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1292"
msgid "...a very unpleasant experience in your near future!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1316"
msgid ""
"Talk like that, and of course you'll be unlucky! You have to straighten out "
"your own life first!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1328"
msgid ""
"But he's cheating on me, too! Why am I the only one getting yelled at? It's "
"not fair!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1340"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1352"
msgid ""
"You again? Your fortune won't have changed so soon after your last reading. "
"Please come back again later."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1388"
msgid "Oh, it's you! Back again, are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1400"
msgid "I'm intrigued by your destiny. I'll give it a look right now, if you'd like."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1412"
msgid ""
"The problem lies in your former life. The same is true of your father. He "
"complains of pain in his legs, does he not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1424"
msgid "Yeah, he said something recently about it being hard to walk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1436"
msgid "(A fortune teller?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1448"
msgid ""
"Do you want me to read your fortune? If so, please get in line. Everybody "
"must wait their turn, after all."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1460"
msgid "No, I⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1472"
msgid "Wait...! Your face... its features are fascinating. Come here for a moment."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1484"
msgid "How about I give you a special reading?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1496"
msgid "No, thank you. I'm not interested in fortune telling."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1508"
msgid "Well, that's unfortunate. Your face alone could lead you to the very top."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1520"
msgid ""
"If you ever want to learn more about yourself, come see me. I'll let you "
"jump to the front of the line for a special reading."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid "Sure. I'll give it a try."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid ""
"Ah, a wise decision! Sometimes, you must make quick decisions, because you "
"never know when you'll have the same chance again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1580"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry, but I have to stop here. I'll finish the rest of your reading "
"after I read his fortune..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1592"
msgid "What!? Well, you'd better..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1664"
msgid "Now, could I have your name? Just write it on this piece of paper."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1676"
msgid "Kazuma... Kiryu."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1688"
msgid ""
"Aha... This is the name of a hero. You have the wisdom and resources to be "
"a great victor, but your name foretells a tempestuous future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid "Oh..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1712"
msgid ""
"I can't read a man like you just from your name. I need your physiognomy "
"and palm readings... I should probably look into your past life, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1724"
msgid ""
"I usually charge 150,000 yen for this, but for an interesting man like you, "
"it's only 120,000 yen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1736"
msgid "120,000 yen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1748"
msgid "I'm sorry, but I refuse to pay 120,000 yen for a fortune."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1760"
msgid "I'm sorry to hear that. Beware, the shadow of death hangs over you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid "If you want to know your fate, come back again."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1796"
msgid "Okay. If what you've said is true, I've got to hear what's next."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1808"
msgid "Well then. Do you mind paying the 120,000 yen up front?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1832"
msgid "Here."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1844"
msgid "You paid <Color:8>120,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1856"
msgid "All right, thank you. Now, for your fortune..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1868"
msgid "Let's see... First, let's start with your palm."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1892"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1904"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1916"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1928"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1952"
msgid ""
"...I see it now. You are a hero. But as a hero, you must never forget there "
"are many people supporting you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1964"
msgid "I got it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1976"
msgid "I also see... you are being fooled by someone you trust."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1988"
msgid "What...?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2000"
msgid ""
"But it's better to continue being fooled. You'll be happier that way. You "
"must not let suspicion take over your heart."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2012"
msgid ""
"Well then. Come back whenever you feel lost. I'll shine light on the "
"path... to your future."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "2036"
msgid "What, no cash!? Well, I hope you starve to death!"
msgstr ""

